      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a backgrounder regarding the recent Supreme Court ruling on Chevron deference. Can you give me a quick breakdown of the main arguments for and against it? I also need to know if the concerns raised by the folks who supported the original deference are actually grounded in legal reality or if they're just trying to stall regulatory progress.",
